H('5.F', 3, "A corporation is a business that is what?", "a separate legal entity owned by shareholders", ["owned by one person personally", "a government agency", "always tax-free"], "Shareholders have limited liability.")
H('5.F', 3, "In a partnership, what do owners share?", "profits, losses and responsibilities", ["only profits", "only losses", "nothing"], "Partnerships have two or more owners.")

# 6 financial goals
H('6.A', 3, "A SMART financial goal is one that is what?", "specific, measurable, attainable, relevant and time-bound", ["vague and flexible", "endless", "secret"], "Good goals have clear targets.")
H('6.A', 3, "Saving for a trip next year is what kind of goal?", "a short-term goal", ["a long-term goal", "a retirement goal", "an unattainable goal"], "Short-term goals are within about a year.")
