H('8.H', 3, "Retirement saving is what kind of goal?", "a long-term goal", ["a short-term goal", "a one-week goal", "an immediate goal"], "Time lets investments grow.")
H('8.H', 3, "Investing small amounts regularly over decades helps because of what?", "compound growth", ["lower taxes always", "guaranteed gains", "no risk"], "Consistency builds wealth.")

